{
  "info": {
    "name": "ms_torneos_deportiva · Anexo 2 (Gestión Deportiva)",
    "description": "Pruebas del módulo de gestión deportiva.\n\n**Antes de empezar:** levanta `ms_torneos_deportiva` (puerto 8182) con `npm run start:dev`. Mientras `SECURITY_ENABLED=false` en su `.env`, no hace falta token ni ms_torneos_security.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{adminToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8182/api/deportiva",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "securityUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8181/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "noExiste",
      "value": "999999",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "suffix",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sportFutbolId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sportSalonId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sportFemeninoId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "teamNacionalId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "teamOnceId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Iniciar sesión (solo con SECURITY_ENABLED=true)",
      "description": "Con `SECURITY_ENABLED=false` en el `.env` de ms_torneos_deportiva el token se ignora y esta carpeta se puede saltar.\n\nCon `SECURITY_ENABLED=true`, levanta también ms_torneos_security (8181), llena `adminEmail` y `adminPassword` en las variables y ejecuta esta petición: guarda el token en `adminToken`, que el resto de la colección envía.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Login del administrador (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{securityUrl}}/auth/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login del administrador (si falla, revisa adminEmail y adminPassword)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"adminToken\", pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HU-GD-01 · Deportes",
      "description": "CRUD de deportes con subdeportes: `/api/deportiva/sports`.\n\nEjecuta la carpeta completa en orden (Run folder): cada petición usa los ids que guardan las anteriores, y las últimas borran lo creado. Los nombres llevan un sufijo nuevo en cada corrida para no chocar con datos de corridas anteriores.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Crear Fútbol (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sports",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"  Fútbol {{suffix}}  \",\n  \"description\": \"Once contra once\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Sufijo nuevo en cada corrida para que los nombres no choquen.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"suffix\", Date.now().toString().slice(-6));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const sport = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sportFutbolId\", sport.id);",
                  "pm.test(\"Nombre sin espacios sobrantes, activo y sin padre\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(sport.name).to.eql(\"Fútbol \" + pm.collectionVariables.get(\"suffix\"));",
                  "    pm.expect(sport.active).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(sport.parent).to.eql(null);",
                  "    pm.expect(sport.subSports).to.eql([]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Duplicado sin tilde y en mayúsculas (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sports",
